<title>UK: Rentenbank adds 50 million marks to reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>Rentenbank adds 50 million marks to reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG, has been increased.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN DEM   COUPON   **10 PCT    MATURITY    13.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE   REVERSE FRN   ISS PRICE  99.925    PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    97.75     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFRT	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  2.175     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN MARKS ON 21.OCT.96</p>
<p>	    **FOR FIRST TWO YEARS, STEPPING UP TO 17 PCT LESS</p>
<p>		TWO TIMES 6M MARK LIBOR FLAT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
